# {{.Name}}

{{.AppName}}.

## Menjalankan

```bash
go run ./cmd
```

Konfigurasi ada di `internal/resources/config.yml`; setiap nilai bisa di-override lewat environment variable (`APP_*`).

## Struktur

```
cmd/                  entrypoint
appservice/           wiring fx semua module
external/             client ke partner / gateway (satu package per partner)
internal/appconfig/   config spesifik aplikasi (key app.*)
internal/di/          provider umum: base config, validator, resty client
internal/router/      route per feature + exception handler + request filter
internal/controller/  parsing & validasi request
internal/usecase/     business logic
internal/repository/  akses database
internal/model/       dto, rc (response code), cerror
pkg/http/             helper response
```

Dibuat dengan `svcgen`. Tambah feature / partner baru:

```bash
svcgen add feature <feature> --action <action> [--method POST] [--public]
svcgen add external <partner>
```

Jangan hapus komentar `// svcgen:*` dan `# svcgen:*` — itu penanda tempat `svcgen` mendaftarkan kode baru.
